        <body>
            <div xml:id="d13">

                <pb facs="0127" n="15" xml:id="pg15"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/3664: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate Peace to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-18T17:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 18,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 6:34
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>330. Your 200, January 12, 8 p.m. Replying to your confidential inquiry contained
                    in last sentence, can only say that explanation of publicity here is to be found
                    in internal political situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>] <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
